# Enterprise Process Charter: ITSM Incident & Change Management

## 1. Process Overview
* **Process Name:** Enterprise Incident & Change Escalation Process
* **Process Owner:** Country IT Manager
* **Target Audience:** IT Service Desk, Regional Network Engineers, Third-Party Vendors

## 2. Process Governance & Roles (RACI Matrix)
| Role / Function | Incident Response | CAB Review | Emergency Change Execution |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Country IT Manager** | Accountable (A) | Approver (A) | Responsible (R) |
| **Lead Engineer** | Responsible (R) | Consulted (C) | Executing (R) |
| **Service Desk Lead** | Support (S) | Informed (I) | Informed (I) |

## 3. Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) & Process Control
* **First Contact Resolution (FCR):** > 70%
* **SLA Compliance Rate:** > 99%
* **Unplanned Change Rate:** < 2%
